{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1795123826912190002,"compiled_state":{"alias":"promising-unwasteful-xantus","assignee":null,"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"e54f0f9cd875d6050b045af20f00792d12f7ba3c24b2dcbf9100adbdb8a2dbe4","event_uuid":"0fdffe3d-e38e-44eb-acb1-033efbcb5310","position":{"commit_sha":"ac6239b5dfbc18ba61272986f057ee8d49da59f1","position":"1795123784877533001-0fdffe3d-e38e-44eb-acb1-033efbcb5310"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIMQNvvCya66a6YyDlxwkxjjJPN3uaFI+QD3OjyC8e1UF rebar-mac-492a5c71 joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com 20261119"},{"content_hash":"cda5d3dbe0a1d2f422ffadacc5c38c229a68a79a534f3efa139a2d2f9c8acd7d","event_uuid":"8c0460a1-875f-4647-8f2a-5cf08f928afa","position":{"commit_sha":"3ce1f78f07e54f946c50a06b64d219d6ee78e4e0","position":"1795123826912190001-8c0460a1-875f-4647-8f2a-5cf08f928afa"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIMQNvvCya66a6YyDlxwkxjjJPN3uaFI+QD3OjyC8e1UF rebar-mac-492a5c71 joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com 20261119"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1795123784877533001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"8c0460a1-875f-4647-8f2a-5cf08f928afa","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"df01-290f-89a2-4ce8"}],"description":"## Observation\nThe MCP server signs every event it writes with its op-cert key. `infra/compose/docker-compose.yml` sets `REBAR_IDENTITY_SIGNING_KEY: /run/secrets/opcert-ed25519-key` for the `mcp` service, and `_apply_authorship` (`src/rebar/_commands/_seam.py`) signs each MCP-written event with that key under principal 594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d. Identity 594c's keyring does not hold that key.\n\nSince starving-sphalerite-skua (Gerrit 3460), such a signature classifies `signer-not-on-keyring`, which fails enforced `verify-identity` like `key_not_valid_at_era`. On the tickets history that is 6,101 verdicts from 2 op-cert keys: SHA256:biqEFL9T969c… (3,344) and SHA256:YWib9Gj1qZ+x… (2,757). Every new MCP write adds another.\n\n## Not decided here\nHow MCP writes should be signed is open: a dedicated authorship key on the writing identity's keyring, registering the existing key, or another option. Each choice needs a keyring or deployment change by the operator. This ticket records the defect only; no keyring or deployment change was made.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] A new event written through the MCP server classifies `verified` under enforced `verify-identity`; checked by writing one event through MCP and running `verify-identity --all` against the tracker with enforcement on.","env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"releases":[],"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"97f7-b448-9cdb-47ce","ticket_type":"bug","title":"MCP server signs events with its op-cert key, which is not on the author's keyring","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["0fdffe3d-e38e-44eb-acb1-033efbcb5310","8c0460a1-875f-4647-8f2a-5cf08f928afa"]},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1795123826912190002,"uuid":"5d45696f-5041-49d5-966e-a6eb915b4347"}